@* Fix #3 — Removed global [Authorize]. Authorization is now enforced at the
   Router layer (App.razor's <AuthorizeRouteView> with <NotAuthorized> sending
   anonymous users to RedirectToLogin). Pages no longer inherit a silent
   auth requirement that breaks library/layout components (NavMenu, BottomNav)
   which intentionally render auth-conditional UI. Admin-only pages still
   declare [Authorize(Roles="Administrator")] explicitly. *@
